🎬 YouTube Clone

A responsive YouTube Clone website built using HTML5 and CSS3. This project recreates the main YouTube interface, including the header, sidebar, search bar, video grid, thumbnails, channel information, and video details.

📌 Features

- 🎥 YouTube-style video grid
- 🔍 Search bar and search button
- 📱 Responsive layout
- 📂 Navigation sidebar
- 🖼️ Video thumbnails with duration
- 👤 Channel profile pictures and information
- 🔗 Clickable video thumbnails
- 🎨 YouTube-inspired UI design
- 📐 CSS Grid and Flexbox layouts

🛠️ Technologies Used

- HTML5 – Website structure
- CSS3 – Styling and responsive layouts

📂 Project Structure

youtube-clone/
│
├── youtube.html
├── Styles/
├── icons/
├── thumbnails/
├── channel-picture/
└── README.md

🚀 How to Run

1. Clone the repository:

git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/youtube-clone.git

2. Open the project in VS Code.
3. Open "youtube.html".
4. Run it using Live Server or open it directly in your browser.

